WEBVTT

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.010
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.210
Get this to Kitaro...

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.050
If I just...

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.040
It's too risky!

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:29.250
Don't do it!

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:38.280
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:41.250
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:44.960
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

