<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.760
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:37.630
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:37.630
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:42.510
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.510 --> 00:01:42.510
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.640
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:46.640
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:50.060
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:50.060
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.530
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:54.530
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.860
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:58.860
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:02.830
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:02.830
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:07.790
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:07.790
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.540
CHAPTER 37

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:41.470
SHOWDOWN!! BACKBEARD

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:46.460
Mana-chan! Wake up, Mana-chan!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:52.390
Thank goodness you're awake.

00:02:54.920 --> 00:02:57.520
I'm... alive?

00:02:57.920 --> 00:03:04.660
That <i>chanchanko</i> woven from our ancestors'
spirit hair saved you, Mana-chan.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.180
Wh-What was...?

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:20.720
They probably used to be human.

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:25.770
Hold on a minute.
Then everybody was turned into <i>yokai</i>?

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:27.770
Even Mom and Dad?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.100
Am I going to become a <i>yokai</i>, too?!

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.780
That's what confuses me.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:36.870
Why aren't you affected
by the Brigadoon, Mana-chan?

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:40.850
Don't ask me. I have no idea!

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:43.490
What happened to your hand?

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:51.090
I've got it! It's a witch's kiss.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:53.790
That must have been what saved you.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:00.430
Where's Kitaro?

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:06.760
I'm concerned about Kitaro, but we have to
stop the Brigadoon Project at all costs.

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.390
All right.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:22.990
This shall make Japan, no, the world
my Backbeard Empire.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:33.210
U-Um, could we talk this over?

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.140
Oh, perhaps you prefer English?

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:41.540
H-Hi. Nice to meet you.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:46.140
Love and peace!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.420
There's Kitaro!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:53.770
Agnes!

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:55.990
What should we do?

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:57.570
Hmm...

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.350
Human child.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:03.650
Get this to Kitaro...

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:19.880
Don't, Mana-chan!

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.740
She has the same look
in her eyes as Agnes.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:33.090
I won't say I'm sorry.

00:05:33.410 --> 00:05:36.490
An apology won't make you believe me.

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.320
You're right. It won't.

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:40.760
But, I can tell this much.

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:44.370
You truly want to save Agnes.

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:45.320
That's right.

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:48.870
I want to save her and Kitaro, too.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.240
Please...

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:51.830
Human child.

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:54.440
What should I do with this?

00:05:54.770 --> 00:05:57.420
Just drop it near Kitaro.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:00.960
It should restore his <i>yokai</i> power.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:09.640
Mana-chan, don't!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.150
If I just...

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.390
It's too risky!

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.110
Don't do it!

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.770
Look out!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.510
Interesting.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:39.660
A human who bathes in the light of the
Brigadoon, yet doesn't become a <i>yokai</i>.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.960
Mana, stay back!

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:51.050
Little insect.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.970
Don't, Backbeard!

00:06:58.710 --> 00:06:59.810
Mana!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.520
Kitaro!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.610
You dare meddle.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.520
Finger Guns!

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:05.840
Kitaro!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.870
Now for Agnes...

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.170
He's still alive?!

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:42.120
BRIGADOON PHENOMENON
POP!

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:46.630
JINDAI BOTANICAL GARDENS
LARGE GREENHOUSE

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:45.560
-<i>"No, no."</i>
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>

00:08:45.690 --> 00:08:46.560
<i>"Sorry."</i>

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:50.880
It's been a millennia
since I've taken this form.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:55.760
I congratulate your strength
on forcing me to take it.

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.050
But this ends now.

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.020
Oh no!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.410
Wally Wall!

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:11.280
Good job, Wally Wall!

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:12.870
You're just a dog!

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.530
I'm not a dog! I'm a wolf!

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.950
Kitaro...

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.160
Human child...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.260
Now is our chance to save Agnes.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:38.640
Take me to my sister.

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:42.060
I can't move on my own anymore.

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:45.060
Please, human child...

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:58.350
All right!

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.530
You have my thanks.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:14.550
Flesh against flesh!

00:10:14.550 --> 00:10:18.630
I haven't felt this feeling
in a millennia! I've missed it!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:24.610
Something feels really wrong.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.320
It's because evil intent is swirling here.

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:29.320
Try to maintain yourself.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:32.440
Otherwise you'll be swept into darkness.

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:37.530
Agnes...

00:10:43.260 --> 00:10:45.240
What's wrong? Is that all?

00:10:56.530 --> 00:10:58.630
Such fools.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.390
Don't!

00:11:27.470 --> 00:11:31.090
No one can stop the Brigadoon.

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:34.340
Now Japan will be mine as well.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.730
Backbeard...!

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:50.730
You whelp... Know your place!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.070
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.210
Hold on! It's just a little further!

00:12:05.210 --> 00:12:06.250
Okay.

00:12:06.250 --> 00:12:07.520
Look.

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.750
Agnes...

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.650
That's right. We're saving Agnes!

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:19.840
Internal Electricity!

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.170
Just a little further!

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:35.570
Human child, you have my thanks again.

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:39.940
I shall now use my life to save Agnes.

00:12:40.260 --> 00:12:42.650
Adele... You...

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:45.600
Hurry and get out of here.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:04.840
Agnes...!

00:13:05.280 --> 00:13:06.260
Adele!

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:09.290
I sacrifice my life.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:14.820
Mother, give me the strength
to save Agnes!

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:21.350
Very well. If you intend to defy me
that much, I shall reduce you to dust.

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.990
Oh no! What intense <i>yokai</i> power!

00:13:36.310 --> 00:13:39.030
This is the end!

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:40.960
Finger Guns!

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:52.300
Kitaro, why do you resist?

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:57.810
All I'm trying to do is rule the world
and rid it of conflict.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.520
I don't want to be ruled by you!

00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:06.860
The strong get the world.
It's a basic law of nature.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:12.070
The weak like yourself need only
accept one small condition.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:16.210
Worship me as your emperor.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:19.910
Just follow my commands and be slaves.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:25.840
If you do, I'm saying I will protect
the lives of you weaklings.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:29.520
A peaceful world without conflict.

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:33.350
Is that not the world
you weaklings desire above all else?

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:40.350
A world where the strong
naturally rule over the weak?

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.910
You'll protect us, so we should be slaves?

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:46.270
Worship you as emperor?

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:53.200
Anger is seeping into the <i>chanchanko</i>
woven from our ancestors' spirit hair!

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.540
Such a world...

00:14:57.180 --> 00:15:00.210
and the existence of tyrants like you...

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:01.920
I hate it!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.350
The strong should control the world.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.350
Obey the strong like
the weakling you are, Kitaro.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:19.860
Someone who can't care for others
could never rule the world!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.360
How impertinent.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:24.620
Soon the Brigadoon will be complete.

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:29.580
Japan will become part of my
Backbeard Empire like that peninsula did.

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.610
Give it up.

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:37.340
You mean Miminaga and the others?!

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:38.840
Miminaga?

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:42.380
Ah, that pathetic little <i>yokai</i>.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:46.600
He was a weakling that
wasn't even worth being alive.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:50.430
No one can determine another's worth.

00:15:50.430 --> 00:15:52.340
No one should ever.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:58.150
Against someone like you
who says such things

00:15:58.150 --> 00:16:01.190
I can never lose!

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.940
Wh-What is this power?!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:18.120
Ag... nes...

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:42.340
Backbeard-sama lost?!

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.540
What am I doing here?

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.320
What was I doing?

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.800
Mother...

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.860
Sister...?

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:42.490
Agnes.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.960
Agnes.

00:18:03.120 --> 00:18:05.730
Didn't I tell you Kitaro's strong?

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:09.730
Yes!

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:14.640
Thank you, Kitaro and everyone!

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:36.510
Agnes is leaving.

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:40.060
Huh? Isn't she going to live in
the GeGeGe Forest?

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:43.150
We tried to convince her to stay.

00:18:43.150 --> 00:18:48.770
Now that she's free from the binds of
being a witch, she wants to see the world.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:53.270
They're going to Miminaga's country
to pay their respects first.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:56.140
Traveling, huh? I'm jealous.

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:58.700
But I'll miss her.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.960
We'd just become friends.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:03.130
Well then, Mana-chan.

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:06.490
Would you like to
come say goodbye to Agnes?

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:10.670
But I thought Agnes is
in the GeGeGe Forest.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.580
I can't enter...

00:19:12.900 --> 00:19:15.920
I believe you should be able to now.

00:19:16.280 --> 00:19:17.330
Huh?

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:45.460
This is our home.

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:48.880
Wow! This is where you live?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.790
Come on. Agnes is waiting.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:55.590
Come back to this forest some time.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:59.060
That's right. We'll always welcome you.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.920
Wally Wall.

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:05.730
It's such a shame all the cute girls
are goin' away.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:08.820
Can't you see
the pretty young thing beside you?!

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:11.740
What are ya talkin' about,
ya shriveled old prune?

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:14.530
-I won't kiss you anymore!
-Agnes!

00:20:14.530 --> 00:20:16.360
Mana! Kitaro!

00:20:16.670 --> 00:20:21.120
Human child, no, Mana.
Thank you for all you've done.

00:20:21.120 --> 00:20:23.190
Take care, Adele-san.

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:25.620
Agnes, will we meet again?

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:27.000
Of course!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.360
Thank you so much, Mana.

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:34.490
Because of you, I really...

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.800
The sandwiches...

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.970
The pumpkin sweets...

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:42.640
The <i>taiyaki</i>...

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:44.640
They were all delicious.

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:54.520
I'll be back for more soon,
so show me around then.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:56.150
You promise?

00:20:57.090 --> 00:20:58.400
I promise.

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:07.610
Goodbye!

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.280
Take care.

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:22.460
See you, Agnes.

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:43.050
<i>Two more</i>

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:47.300
<i>Two, two, two, two more</i>

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:52.060
<i>Rejoice that the vessel shall be filled</i>

00:21:52.600 --> 00:21:56.730
<i>When the hollow vessel is filled</i>

00:21:56.850 --> 00:22:02.070
<i>Hell shall open upon this world</i>

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:10.490
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.610 --> 00:22:10.490
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.330
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.330
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:17.250
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:14.450 --> 00:22:17.250
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.540
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.540
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:24.840
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:19.670 --> 00:22:24.840
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.430
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:25.170 --> 00:22:27.430
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:35.730
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:32.970 --> 00:22:35.730
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:35.980 --> 00:22:38.100
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:43.480
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:43.480
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:46.030
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:43.780 --> 00:22:46.030
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:51.530
<i>See how many ghosts there are</i>

00:22:46.150 --> 00:22:51.530
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:54.080
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:54.080
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:59.000
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:59.000
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>They're near you</i>

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:03.420
<i>kimi no chikaku ni</i>

00:23:06.380 --> 00:23:08.550
<i>A corpse robbery during New Year's.</i>

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:11.640
<i>Dad, this is must be the work of...</i>

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:14.640
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.770 --> 00:23:17.350
<i>"New Year's Man-Eating Fable
Kasha"</i>

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
